        "FICTIONAL BRIEF / DESIGN INTENT, NOT TEST RESULTS / 02",
        "A story workshop for shared spaces",
        "01 WORDS",
        "A short invitation that lets adults and children respond in their own words.",
        "02 PATHS",
        "Three moments in twenty minutes. Paper materials; no personal device required.",
        "03 RETURN",
        "A chance to revise or simply listen. Attendance and impact remain unmeasured."
