      "source": "ppt/slides/slide4.xml",
      "text": [
        "CONTRIBUTION / CREDIT AND BOUNDARIES",
        "CREDIT NAMED CONTRIBUTIONS / NO IMPLIED CLIENT ENDORSEMENT / 04",
        "What I made. What we shared.",
        "Opening language",
        "I wrote the invitation, response prompts and closing reflection.",
        "Workshop sequence",
        "I outlined the twenty-minute sequence. Ren Cole contributed the facilitation prompts.",
        "Not delivered yet",
        "No workshop has run. Recruitment, venue access and facilitator preparation remain unresolved."
      ],
      "shapes": {
        "sp": 12
      }
    },
